{v_1 : tensor, p: float, training: bool, inplace:bool} |= if training ∧ p > 0 ∧ inplace then dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 50 (When training is True and p > 0, the input tensor cannot be a bool tensor if inplace is True. )
{v_1 : tensor, p: float, training: bool, inplace: bool} |= if training ∧ p > 0 ∧ inplace then dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
